WEBVTT

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:03.430
and is it a force 
either one of them can control?

00:02:03.430 --> 00:02:06.080
The collision of different worlds
is a common thread

00:02:06.080 --> 00:02:08.110
in Haruki Murakami’s work.

00:02:08.110 --> 00:02:12.352
His novels and short stories 
often forge fantastic connections

00:02:12.352 --> 00:02:14.358
between personal experience,

00:02:14.358 --> 00:02:18.278
supernatural possibilities, 
and Japanese history.

00:02:18.278 --> 00:02:20.648
Born in Kyoto in 1949,

00:02:20.648 --> 00:02:23.468
Murakami grew up 
during the post-World War II

00:02:23.468 --> 00:02:26.348
American occupation of Japan.

00:02:26.348 --> 00:02:30.310
The shadow of war 
hung over his life as it does his fiction;